<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>AstroCode — Projectile Motion Lab</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink:#241b3a; --muted:#6c6280;
      --plum-1:#221333; --plum-2:#3d1f63;
      --violet:#7c3aed; --violet-deep:#5b21b6; --violet-mid:#8b5cf6;
      --violet-soft:#f1eafe; --violet-line:#ded0f8;
      --panel:#ffffff; --soft:#f8f5ff;
      --good:#15803d; --good-bg:#e3faea; --good-line:#8fe3ac;
      --bad:#b91c1c; --bad-bg:#fdeaea; --bad-line:#f3a8a8;
      --warn-bg:#fff7df; --warn-line:#f4d985; --warn-ink:#6b5b31;
    }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    body { margin:0; font-family:'Inter', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif; color:var(--ink); background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7f2ff 0%,#fbf9ff 45%,#f3ecff 100%); }
    h1,h2,h3,h4,.brand,.step,.home-kicker { font-family:'Space Grotesk','Inter',sans-serif; }
    header { background:linear-gradient(120deg,var(--plum-1),var(--plum-2)); color:white; padding:21px max(24px, calc((100% - 1240px)/2)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:20px; box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(45,15,70,.35); }
    .brand { display:flex; gap:12px; align-items:center; font-size:24px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.6px; }
    .tag { font-size:12.5px;color:#dcc9fb;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:0; }
    .teacher { border:1px solid #6f4f9c; border-radius:999px;padding:8px 13px;color:#ecdffb;font-size:13px; }
    main { max-width:1240px; margin:27px auto 48px; padding:0 20px; }

    /* ---------- home / learn landing ---------- */
    .home{padding:8px 0 20px}
    .hero-banner{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:22px;padding:52px 48px;box-shadow:0 16px 35px rgba(90,40,150,.10);position:relative;overflow:hidden}
    .hero-banner:before,.hero-banner:after{content:'';position:absolute;border:1px solid #e2d3fb;border-radius:50%;width:330px;height:330px;opacity:.6}
    .hero-banner:before{top:-250px;left:-200px}.hero-banner:after{bottom:-270px;right:-160px}
    .home-kicker{color:var(--violet);font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1.4px;font-weight:700;position:relative}
    .hero-banner h1{font-size:36px;margin:13px 0 15px;position:relative;letter-spacing:-.8px}
    .hero-banner p{max-width:660px;margin:0 auto;color:#5c5470;line-height:1.7;font-size:15.5px;position:relative}
    .hero-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px;position:relative}
    .begin{border:0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--violet),var(--violet-deep));color:#fff;font:700 15px 'Inter';padding:13px 21px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 7px 14px rgba(124,58,237,.32)}
    .begin:hover{filter:brightness(1.08)}
    .begin.ghost{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);color:var(--violet-deep);box-shadow:none}
    .begin.ghost:hover{background:var(--violet-soft)}
    .stat-strip{display:flex;gap:30px;justify-content:center;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;position:relative}
    .stat{text-align:center}
    .stat strong{display:block;font-size:25px;color:#4c1d95}
    .stat span{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px}

    .learn-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 300px;gap:24px;margin-top:34px;text-align:left}
    .learn-main{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:28px}
    .section-block{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:18px;padding:22px 24px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(90,40,150,.06)}
    .section-block h2{font-size:19px;margin:0 0 4px}
    .section-sub{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 14px}

    .concept-card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:12px}
    .flip-card{perspective:1000px;height:145px;cursor:pointer}
    .flip-inner{position:relative;width:100%;height:100%;transition:transform .5s;transform-style:preserve-3d}
    .flip-card.flipped .flip-inner{transform:rotateY(180deg)}
    .flip-front,.flip-back{position:absolute;inset:0;backface-visibility:hidden;border-radius:14px;padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}
    .flip-front{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--violet),var(--violet-deep));color:#fff}
    .flip-back{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);transform:rotateY(180deg)}
    .flip-front h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px}
    .flip-front span{font-size:10.5px;opacity:.85}
    .flip-back p{margin:0;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#4a4160}

    .equation-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
    .equation-card{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px}
    .equation-card code{display:block;font-size:16px;font-weight:800;color:#4c1d95;margin-bottom:6px}
    .equation-card span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted)}
    .equation-note{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:12px 2px 0;line-height:1.55}

    .split-panel{display:grid;grid-template-columns:190px 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px}
    .split-diagram{width:100%;height:auto}
    .split-text p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.65;color:#4a4160;margin:0 0 10px}
    .split-text p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
    .split-text code{background:var(--violet-soft);color:#5b21b6;padding:2px 5px;border-radius:5px;font-weight:700}

    .side-card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:16px;padding:18px;margin-bottom:18px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(90,40,150,.06)}
    .side-card h3{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:15px}
    .case-quicklink{display:block;width:100%;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;margin-top:9px;font:700 12.5px 'Inter';color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer}
    .case-quicklink:hover{background:var(--violet-soft);border-color:#b794f6}
    .accordion{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;margin-top:10px}
    .acc-item{width:100%;text-align:left;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);background:#fff;border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;font:700 12px 'Inter';color:var(--ink);cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:8px}
    .acc-item.open{background:var(--violet-soft);border-radius:10px 10px 0 0}
    .acc-body{display:none;font-size:11.5px;color:#4a4160;line-height:1.6;padding:2px 12px 12px;background:var(--violet-soft);border-radius:0 0 10px 10px;margin-top:-8px}
    .acc-body.show{display:block}

    /* ---------- case chooser ---------- */
    .choose-screen{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:20px;padding:34px;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(90,40,150,.08)}
    .choose-heading{text-align:center;max-width:650px;margin:0 auto 27px}
    .choose-heading h2{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 8px}
    .choose-heading p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:15px}
    .case-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
    .case-card{cursor:pointer;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:15px;overflow:hidden;text-align:left;padding:0;transition:.2s;color:var(--ink);font:inherit}
    .case-card:hover{border-color:#b794f6;transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 13px 24px rgba(124,58,237,.16)}
    .case-card .diagram{height:170px;background:#f8f4ff;display:block;width:100%}
    .case-card .copy{padding:15px}
    .case-card h3{font-size:16px;margin:0 0 6px}
    .case-card p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.42;margin:0}
    .case-number{display:inline-block;color:var(--violet);font-weight:700;font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.7px;margin-bottom:7px}

    /* ---------- lab ---------- */
    .layout { display:grid; grid-template-columns:326px 1fr; gap:20px; }
    .panel { background:var(--panel); border:1px solid var(--violet-line); border-radius:18px; box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(90,40,150,.08); }
    .controls { padding:21px; }
    .step { color:var(--violet); font-size:12px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:1px;font-weight:700;margin:2px 0 11px; }
    h2 {font-size:17px;margin:0 0 13px;letter-spacing:-.2px}
    .selected-case{background:var(--violet-soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 11px;color:var(--violet-deep);font-size:13px;font-weight:700}
    .case-reference{margin:10px 0 3px;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--soft)}
    .case-reference svg{display:block;width:100%;height:120px}
    .change-case{background:none;border:0;color:var(--violet);font:700 12px 'Inter';padding:5px 0;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:underline}
    .divider{height:1px;background:var(--violet-line);margin:20px 0}
    .mode-toggle{display:flex;gap:4px;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:999px;padding:4px}
    .mode-toggle button{flex:1;border:0;background:transparent;padding:9px 6px;border-radius:999px;font:700 12px 'Inter';color:var(--muted);cursor:pointer;transition:.15s}
    .mode-toggle button.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--violet),var(--violet-deep));color:#fff;box-shadow:0 4px 10px rgba(124,58,237,.3)}
    .mode-toggle.small button{padding:7px 4px;font-size:11px}
    .mode-note{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);margin:9px 2px 0;line-height:1.5}
    .planet-row{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--soft);border-radius:12px;padding:10px 11px;margin-bottom:15px}
    .planet-icon{font-size:28px}
    .planet-row small{display:block;color:var(--muted);margin-top:2px}
    .planet-row strong{font-size:14px}
    select,input {font:inherit;border:1px solid #ddd0f7;border-radius:9px;padding:10px;color:var(--ink);background:white;}
    select{width:100%;margin:7px 0 5px}
    label{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#4d4460;margin:11px 0 0}
    .input-line { position:relative; } input{width:100%;margin-top:6px;font-weight:600}
    .unit{position:absolute;right:11px;bottom:11px;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px}
    .run{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--violet),var(--violet-deep));color:#fff;font:700 14px 'Inter';margin-top:20px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 6px 12px rgba(124,58,237,.32)}
    .run:hover{filter:brightness(1.07)}
    .given-chips{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin:8px 0 2px}
    .given-chip{background:var(--violet-soft);color:var(--violet-deep);border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap}
    .new-q-btn{width:100%;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);background:#fff;color:var(--violet-deep);border-radius:10px;padding:10px;font:700 13px 'Inter';cursor:pointer;margin-top:12px}
    .new-q-btn:hover{background:var(--violet-soft)}
    .bank-note{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:10px 2px 0;line-height:1.5}
    .workspace{display:grid;grid-template-rows:auto auto;gap:20px}
    .simulation{overflow:hidden;min-height:373px;position:relative;background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 70% 10%,#4c2e79,#1c1030 67%);}
    .simhead{padding:19px 22px 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;color:#fff;gap:14px}
    .simhead h2{margin:0;font-size:18px}
    .simhead p{margin:4px 0 0;font-size:12px;color:#cdbdee}
    .legend{font-size:12px;color:#e6d9fb;display:flex;gap:13px;white-space:nowrap}
    .legend i{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;display:inline-block;background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--violet-mid);margin-right:4px}
    .legend i.g{background:var(--violet-soft);border:2px solid #b294e8}
    canvas {height:276px;width:100%;display:block}
    .sim-note{position:absolute;right:22px;bottom:17px;color:#ece3fb;font-size:12px;background:rgba(30,15,50,.68);padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px}
    .results{padding:20px}
    .result-head{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:14px;gap:12px}
    .result-head h2{margin:0}
    .chip{background:var(--violet-soft);color:var(--violet-deep);border-radius:999px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;padding:6px 9px;white-space:nowrap}
    .metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}
    .metric{background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;font:inherit;color:inherit;transition:.16s}
    .metric:hover,.metric:focus{border-color:#b794f6;background:var(--violet-soft);outline:none;transform:translateY(-1px)}
    .metric .value{font-size:24px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.7px;color:#4c1d95}
    .metric .name{font-size:12px;color:#6b6280;margin-top:3px}
    .metric sup{font-size:13px}
    .result-detail{display:none;margin-top:15px;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:11px;padding:15px 16px;color:#4a4160;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}
    .result-detail.show{display:block}
    .result-detail h3{font-size:14px;color:#5b21b6;margin:0 0 7px}
    .result-detail code{background:var(--violet-soft);color:#5b21b6;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 5px;font-weight:700}
    .working{margin-top:17px;border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:11px;overflow:hidden}
    .work-toggle{width:100%;border:0;background:#fff;text-align:left;padding:12px 14px;color:#5b21b6;font:700 13px 'Inter';cursor:pointer;display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
    .formula{display:none;background:var(--soft);border-top:1px solid var(--violet-line);padding:13px 14px;color:#4a4160;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75}
    .formula.show{display:block}
    .formula code{background:var(--violet-soft);color:#5b21b6;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 5px;font-weight:700}
    .scenario-text{font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--ink);background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin-bottom:14px}
    .diff-pill{display:inline-block;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.4px;margin-right:8px;vertical-align:middle}
    .diff-easy{background:#e3faea;color:#15803d}
    .diff-medium{background:var(--violet-soft);color:var(--violet-deep)}
    .diff-hard{background:#fdeaea;color:#b91c1c}
    .answer-grid{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
    .answer-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 128px 28px;gap:10px;align-items:center;background:var(--soft);border:1px solid var(--violet-line);border-radius:12px;padding:11px 13px;transition:.15s}
    .answer-row.correct{border-color:var(--good-line);background:var(--good-bg)}
    .answer-row.incorrect{border-color:var(--bad-line);background:var(--bad-bg)}
    .answer-row.revealed{border-color:var(--violet-line);background:#fff}
    .answer-label{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--ink)}
    .answer-input{position:relative}
    .answer-input input{width:100%;padding:8px 38px 8px 8px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #ddd0f7;font-weight:700}
    .answer-input input:disabled{background:#fff;opacity:.85}
    .answer-input span{position:absolute;right:9px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--muted)}
    .answer-status{font-size:17px;text-align:center;cursor:pointer}
    .answer-reveal{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:12.5px;color:#4a4160;background:#fff;border-top:1px dashed var(--violet-line);padding-top:9px;margin-top:5px;line-height:1.65;display:none}
    .answer-reveal.show{display:block}
    .answer-reveal code{background:var(--violet-soft);color:#5b21b6;border-radius:5px;padding:2px 5px;font-weight:700}
    .answer-reveal b{color:#4c1d95}
    .practice-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;margin-top:16px;flex-wrap:wrap}
    .check-btn{border:0;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--violet),var(--violet-deep));color:#fff;font:700 14px 'Inter';cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 6px 12px rgba(124,58,237,.3)}
    .check-btn:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default;box-shadow:none}
    .attempts-label{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}
    .practice-feedback{margin-top:12px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--violet-deep);min-height:18px}
    .why{margin-top:20px;padding:17px 19px;background:var(--warn-bg);border:1px solid var(--warn-line);border-radius:14px;display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:start}
    .why b{font-size:14px}
    .why p{margin:3px 0 0;font-size:13px;color:var(--warn-ink);line-height:1.5}
    .bulb{font-size:24px}
    @media(max-width:900px){
      .learn-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .concept-card-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
      .split-panel{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
    @media(max-width:800px){
      header{padding:17px 20px}.teacher{display:none}.layout{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}.choose-screen{padding:22px}.case-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      .case-card .diagram{height:135px}.answer-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.answer-status{text-align:left}
      .hero-banner{padding:34px 22px}.equation-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header><div class="brand"><div>Welcome to AstroCode <span class="tag">Projectile Motion Learning Tool</span></div></div><div class="teacher">Designed for CAPE Unit 1 Physics</div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="home" id="home">
      <div class="hero-banner">
        <div class="home-kicker">CAPE / A-Level Physics · Unit 1, Module 1: Mechanics</div>
        <h1>Master projectile motion — the CAPE way.</h1>
        <p>Projectile motion is just linear motion happening in two directions at once. Below is the theory your notes and the syllabus cover, the mistakes CXC examiners see most often, and a lab where you can explore freely or test yourself with real practice questions.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <button class="begin" id="begin">Choose a motion case →</button>
          <button class="begin ghost" id="jumpPractice">Jump straight to practice questions</button>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-strip">
          <div class="stat"><strong>3</strong><span>motion cases</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>12</strong><span>practice questions</span></div>
          <div class="stat"><strong>3</strong><span>difficulty levels</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="learn-grid">
        <div class="learn-main">
          <div class="section-block">
            <h2>Get your key terms straight</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Tap a card to flip it.</p>
            <div class="concept-card-grid">
              <div class="flip-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('flipped')"><div class="flip-inner">
                <div class="flip-front"><h4>Distance vs Displacement</h4><span>tap to reveal</span></div>
                <div class="flip-back"><p>Distance is the total path length covered — a scalar. Displacement is the straight-line change in position from start to finish, with a direction attached — a vector.</p></div>
              </div></div>
              <div class="flip-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('flipped')"><div class="flip-inner">
                <div class="flip-front"><h4>Speed vs Velocity</h4><span>tap to reveal</span></div>
                <div class="flip-back"><p>Speed is distance covered per unit time — a scalar. Velocity is displacement per unit time — a vector, so it always comes with a direction attached.</p></div>
              </div></div>
              <div class="flip-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('flipped')"><div class="flip-inner">
                <div class="flip-front"><h4>Acceleration</h4><span>tap to reveal</span></div>
                <div class="flip-back"><p>The rate of change of velocity, in m s⁻². An object accelerates whenever it speeds up, slows down, or changes direction — even at constant speed.</p></div>
              </div></div>
              <div class="flip-card" onclick="this.classList.toggle('flipped')"><div class="flip-inner">
                <div class="flip-front"><h4>Vectors vs Scalars</h4><span>tap to reveal</span></div>
                <div class="flip-back"><p>A scalar is fully described by size alone (mass, distance, speed). A vector needs size and direction (displacement, velocity, acceleration) — which is why sign convention matters so much here.</p></div>
              </div></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-block">
            <h2>The four equations of motion</h2>
            <p class="section-sub">Your toolkit for the vertical direction — and the horizontal one too, whenever there's an acceleration.</p>
            <div class="equation-grid">
              <div class="equation-card"><code>v = u + at</code><span>straight from the definition of acceleration</span></div>
              <div class="equation-card"><code>s = ½(u + v)t</code><span>the area under a velocity–time graph</span></div>
              <div class="equation-card"><code>s = ut + ½at²</code><span>substitute v from the first equation into the second</span></div>
              <div class="equation-card"><code>v² = u² + 2as</code><span>eliminate t between the equations above</span></div>
            </div>
            <p class="equation-note">These only hold when acceleration is <b>constant</b> — exactly the situation once a projectile leaves your hand, since gravity alone acts on it from that point.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-block">
            <h2>Why projectile motion "splits in two"</h2>
            <div class="split-panel">
              <svg class="split-diagram" viewBox="0 0 190 150" aria-label="Velocity resolved into horizontal and vertical components">
                <line x1="20" y1="130" x2="170" y2="130" stroke="#c9b6f0" stroke-width="2"/>
                <line x1="20" y1="130" x2="150" y2="30" stroke="#7c3aed" stroke-width="3"/>
                <line x1="20" y1="130" x2="150" y2="130" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2"/>
                <line x1="150" y1="130" x2="150" y2="30" stroke-dasharray="4 4" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2"/>
                <circle cx="20" cy="130" r="4" fill="#7c3aed"/>
                <text x="78" y="145" fill="#4a4160" font-size="11">u cos θ</text>
                <text x="155" y="85" fill="#4a4160" font-size="11">u sin θ</text>
                <text x="60" y="70" fill="#5b21b6" font-size="11" font-weight="700">u</text>
                <path d="M40 130 A20 20 0 0 1 33 113" fill="none" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="1.5"/>
                <text x="42" y="118" fill="#5b21b6" font-size="10">θ</text>
              </svg>
              <div class="split-text">
                <p><b>Horizontally:</b> nothing pushes or pulls the object (air resistance is ignored), so <code>uₓ = u cos θ</code> stays exactly the same all flight. That's ordinary constant-velocity motion: <code>x = uₓt</code>.</p>
                <p><b>Vertically:</b> gravity is the only force, giving a constant acceleration <code>g</code>. Every equation above applies here, with <code>a = ±g</code> depending on the sign convention you pick.</p>
                <p>Because neither direction affects the other, you solve for time using whichever direction gives you enough information, then reuse that same t elsewhere. Eliminating t between the two directions always leaves a quadratic in x — which is exactly why the path is a parabola.</p>
              </div>
